    </property>
    <property name="toolTip">
     <string>Channel A RX tracking offset (Hz). Auto-updates as the modem locks; type a value and press Enter to nudge it.</string>
    </property>
    <property name="whatsThis">
     <string>&lt;b&gt;Channel A RX offset (Hz)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Live offset of the received signal from this channel's centre frequency. The modem updates the value continuously as it tracks the carrier. You can also type a number and press Enter to seed the tracker — useful for pulling in a signal whose centre you already know.</string>
    </property>
