    <property name="whatsThis">
     <string>&lt;b&gt;RX level meter (right channel)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Shows the audio amplitude arriving from the sound card's right input. Adjust the sound card recording level (or the &quot;RX Audio&quot; slider) so the bar stays in the green region. Yellow means the level is too low to demodulate reliably; red indicates clipping that will distort the signal and break demodulation. Note: the modem requires a stereo input even when only one channel carries audio.</string>
    </property>
   </widget>
